  "description": "Recently renovated Apartment for rent  about 5km from Athenry on the Athenry - Monivea road.\n2 story Apartment which is approx 5 mins drive to Athenry town.\n 35 mins drive approx to Galway city on the M6 Motorway.\nAthenry town is a  busy commuter town with a train station.\nIt is a very convenient and popular residential destination as it has excellent access to Galway, Dublin and Limerick etc\nVast array of amenities in Athenry including restaurants, pubs, Tesco, Aldi and other local retail & commercial outlets.\nUpstairs of the apartment comprises of a double bedroom and also another small room which would suit as an office. Hallway and bathroom.\nDownstairs comprises of a fitted kitchen and open plan living area with a modern Pellet stove.\nOil heating also throughout.\nFully furnished.\nParking also included.",
